685: #  note justified 132 by claiming `if (xofs == 0) ok = 0;' would otherwise sweep the table.  That
686: #  is FALSE -- `ycrcb x4y1' already carries xofs 16, so that mutant was caught before this block
687: #  existed, and M39 measures it at 76/77 territory rather than a sweep.  The CHOICE is right and
